// AuditTraceNode One node in a provenance graph. `kind` distinguishes an
// `artifact` (a materialized output), the `step` that produced
// it, a `literal` input leaf (an input with no content hash), a
// `plan_input` leaf (a plan-provided root input sourced from
// `inputs.*` that carries a content hash but has no producing
